<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Simple Money Bond</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 40px;
      color: #333;
      font-size: large;
    }
    h2 {
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: underline;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    p {
      text-align: justify;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    ol {
      margin-left: 20px;
    }
    ul {
      margin-left: 20px;
    }
    strong {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h2>DRAFT OF SIMPLE MONEY BOND</h2>

  <p>
    I, <%= debtorName %>, son of <%= debtorFatherName %> resident of <%= debtorAddress %> confirm that I am indebted to <%= creditorName %> son of <%= creditorFatherName %> resident of <%= creditorAddress %> to the extent of Rs. <%= amount %> (Rupees <%= amountWords %>) on account of the price of <%= itemPurchased %> purchased by me from the said <%= creditorName %> and I hereby agree and covenant to pay the said sum on demand of Rs. <%= amountRepeat %> with interest at the rate of <%= interestRate %> percent per annum to <%= creditorName %>.
  </p>

  <p>Date: <%= date %></p>

  <p>WITNESSES</p>
  <ol>
    <li><%= witness1 %></li>
    <li><%= witness2 %></li>
  </ol>

  <br>
  <p>Signature: <%= debtorSignature %></p>

</body>
</html>